# Generating Content

Call `generate` to get output from the AI:

```javascript
const response = await client.generate('Write a short story about a robot.');
console.log(response);
```

For image generation:

```javascript
client.setType('image');
const imageBlob = await client.generate('A futuristic city at sunset');
const url = URL.createObjectURL(imageBlob);
document.querySelector('#output-image').src = url;
```

**Step Visualization:**
![Generate Content](https://via.placeholder.com/400x200?text=Generate+Content)

# Optional Configurations

You can customize the client further:

```javascript
client.setDimensions(1024,1024); // Image size
client.setSystemPrompt('You are a helpful assistant.');
client.setTimeout(30000);
client.setRetry(true,2,1000);
```

**Step Visualization:**
![Options](https://via.placeholder.com/400x200?text=Optional+Config)
